function increment ( value / i32 ) / Result ( i32 ) (
  return ok ( add ( value, 1 ) ) ·
) ·
function choose ( value / i32, stop / i32 ) / Result ( i32 ) (
  let current / i32 ( try_value ( increment ( value ) ) ) ·
  loop cursor / i32 ( from: 0, max: 2 ) (
    if equal ( cursor, stop ) ( break · ) ~ otherwise ( set current ( wrapping_add ( current, 1 ) ) · continue · ) ·
  ) ·
  return ok ( current ) ·
) ·
